---

Note on Pro features: this repository contains the complete source for
Wektor, including the code paths for Lifetime/Pro-gated features. Those
features are unlocked at runtime by a license key checked against Lemon
Squeezy (see license-manager.js) — there is no separate proprietary codebase.
We publish the whole thing, gate included, because we'd rather be transparent
about how it works than rely on obscurity. If you compile it yourself, that's
allowed under this license; most people still buy a license because it funds
ongoing development, official signed builds (once code signing is set up),
and support.
